## Portions adapted from other projects

The agent skill in `skills/ghana-geosql/` is adapted from
**dekart-xyz/geosql**, MIT licensed, Copyright (c) 2026 dekart.xyz.
https://github.com/dekart-xyz/geosql

The pipeline structure in `pipelines/` and the analysis and QC approach in
`db/` are adapted from **rafimt/geospatial-data-pipeline**.
https://github.com/rafimt/geospatial-data-pipeline
